  vendorName: Neighbor Ned
  offerText: I'll pay you to watch my tiny turtle for a week! He takes up no room
    and he's so fun.
  acceptResultText: You take the cash. The turtle is quiet and cute.
  rejectResultText: Ned cries. You feel like a terrible neighbor and lose sleep over
    it.
  delayedText: Ned never returned. The 'turtle' grew into a massive snapping turtle
    that bit your finger and needs a huge tank.
